  "title": "Request access to edit views and ideas",
  "product": "Jira Product Discovery",
  "status": "rollout_complete",
  "description": "Jira Product Discovery users can now request edit permissions directly from the view header. This change allows people with view-only access to easily ask for the permissions they need to contribute to ideas and manage views, reducing friction and helping teams collaborate more effectively. Open a space in Jira Product Discovery where you have view-only access.\n\tSelect Request access in the view header.\n\tWait for an admin to review and approve your request.",
